@title Cedarwood Elementary Open House
@subtitle Thursday, November 12, 2026, 17:30 to 19:30
@author Dr. Leonie Osei, Principal

Welcome, families! We would love to see you at our open house. Come meet our teachers, look around your child's future school and ask us anything.

## When and where
Thursday, November 12, 2026, from 17:30 to 19:30, in the main building at 410 Elm Street.

## Schedule
1. 17:30: welcome from the principal in the gym
2. 17:50: classroom tours in groups of 8 families, each about 30 minutes
3. 18:30: kindergarten information session in the library
4. 18:45: after-school program table in the cafeteria
5. 19:15: closing words

## What to bring
If you plan to register for 2027-28 kindergarten, please bring a birth certificate, proof of address and immunization records. Registration opens on January 12, 2027.

## Getting here
- Free parking in the Elm Street lot, which has 60 spaces
- A free shuttle every 10 minutes from the Pine Street church lot
- Childcare for siblings, offered in the music room

## Questions
Call 555-0166 or write to office@cedarwood.example. We look forward to meeting you.
